    "claim": "The chart ranks the 51 most-played Billboard hits from Lose Yourself with 59,039,765 plays first to Sultans Of Swing with 25,138,802 51st, with Mr. Brightside (54,367,533), Numb (52,969,898), Don't Stop Believin' (50,855,135) and Smells Like Teen Spirit (50,657,282) in places two through five.",
    "tables": {
      "d": "data/all_data.csv"
    },
    "code": "d.nlargest(51, 'count')[['artist', 'track', 'count']]"
  },
  {
    "id": "lose-yourself-billboard-2002-rank",
