  },
  {
    "source": "PEAK BILLBOARD POSITION #6 OF 100 #9 #2 #2 #1",
    "why": "Four of the five peak positions match, but the data gives Wonderwall a Billboard peak of 8, not the 2 labelled in the top-5 table, so the peak-position finding as a whole does not reproduce."
  },
  {
    "source": "#42 OF 385, 1991 #57 OF 346, 1998 #45 OF 314, 1996 #20 OF 370, 1992 #5 OF 314, 1996",
    "why": "The rank positions (42, 57, 45, 20, 5) reproduce, but the 1996 and 1998 chart sizes are 312 and 344 in the data, not the 314 and 346 printed in these labels; only the rank positions are kept in facts.json."
